      "system": {
        "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The stingwing&nbsp;is smaller than most characters. The creature&rsquo;s normal HP decreases to Body + &frac12; level (rounded up), but its Defense increases by 1. Further, it is slain by any hit which inflicts an Injury.</span></p>",
